WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Meet Sams Accounting Desktop, a focused workspace for everyday accounting automation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Start by importing a selectable bank statement PDF.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The app reads dates, narration, debit, credit, and balances into a structured voucher preview.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Review each transaction, choose the correct bank and opposite ledger, and reconcile entries before posting.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:44.000
When everything is ready, send the verified vouchers directly to Tally Prime.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Less repetitive entry, fewer handoff errors, and a clearer path from bank statement to books.
